= BickyGate 

A recent exposé has revealed the Prime Minister recieved £40,000 in shares of the Biscuit manufacturer, McVities along with a Daimler. In exchange for granting a peerage to the company's founder, childhood friend of the Prime Minister, Alexander Grant. 


